; --- The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild: the corrie. Twelve rock clusters and four pines turn a flat 50 x 40 field with two
; --- tents in the middle of it into a horseshoe of rock with ONE narrow throat, a camp inside it,
; --- and a scramble over the northern lip for anyone who looks. The camp was previously visible and
; --- reachable from every direction at once, which is not a camp — it is three props on a floor.

